      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9166/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine creamed corn, 1/2 cup cracker crumbs, 1/4 cup melted butter, and eggs in a large bowl; mix well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Pxh_WiON4l0AP5ef0G-o7Qv4Tn8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-9166-Old-Fashioned-Scalloped-Corn-DDMFS-4x3-step-03-37e121c80d054c118a679227aa733618.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9166/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture into the prepared dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/z-P-TMPkzsivS7_ULGQ5FZH3614=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-9166-Old-Fashioned-Scalloped-Corn-DDMFS-4x3-step-04-44c62fe4bbf946b1b93eaaa6ec3038f4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9166/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix remaining 1/2 cup cracker crumbs and remaining 1/4 cup melted butter with paprika and pepper in a small bowl. Sprinkle crumb topping over casserole.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
